Package: glamour
Title: Personal ggplot2 Themes and Utilities Inspired by the Glamour of Graphics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("James", "Hodges", email = "jamesdavidhodges@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A personal collection of ggplot2 theme functions, color palettes,
    typography helpers, and annotation utilities built around the visual design
    principles from Will Chase's "Glamour of Graphics" (rstudio::conf 2020).
    Encourages direct labeling, intentional typography, stripped-down grids,
    and purposeful color use.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/James-Hodges/glamourtheming, https://jameshodges.cc/projects/glamour-theming/
BugReports: https://github.com/James-Hodges/glamourtheming/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
